exports[`Lumen & Loom Studio > Business System › 1. Foundation > tile segment-8lu427u5:value-proposition 1`] = `
"Value PropositionValue PropositioniValue PropositioniFor Londoners who want a calm, personal home without the throwaway cycle, Lumen & Loom makes handwoven cushions, throws and linens in Hackney from traceable British wool and organic cotton. Each piece is signed by its maker and repaired for life, and we teach you to weave your own. You know exactly who made it, where the yarn came from, and that it will last.Emotional NeedsCalmFulfilledDelightedProudNurturedSocial NeedsStylishIncludedAltruisticBack‹›Back
[fields] For Londoners who want a calm, personal home without the throwaway cycle, Lumen & Loom makes handwoven cushions, throws and linens in Hackney from traceable British wool and organic cotton. Each piece is signed by its maker and repaired for life, and we teach you to weave your own. You know exactly who made it, where the yarn came from, and that it will last."
`;

