exports[`Lumen & Loom Studio > Identity System › 1. Definition > tile mission-vision 1`] = `
"Mission & VisionMissioniWho do you serve first?i 2 maxLondon HomemakersDesigners & Boutique HotelsWhat do you offer them?i 3 maxHomeware CollectionWeaving WorkshopsWhat do they gain?i 2 maxExpressionDevelopmentTo bring slow, handmade craft back into everyday homes: making beautiful, durable textiles from responsibly sourced materials, paying fair prices along our supply chain, and teaching people the skills to make and repair for themselves.VisioniWhere will your customers be?iIn my city / townIn my state / regionAcross my countryIn several countriesWorldwideToday: Across my countryiWhat will your business be when your Vision comes true?i 3 maxServing a large, growing customer baseLoved & recommended by its customersOffering a strong, growing rangeProfitable & paying its own wayKnown & trusted in its fieldRunning smoothly with a strong teamWorking closely with strong partnersBy 2030, to be London's best-known independent weaving studio: a self-sustaining team of eight makers, a collection stocked by twenty UK independent retailers, a waiting list for our workshops, and a verified low-carbon supply chain from sheep to sofa.Back‹›Back
[fields] To bring slow, handmade craft back into everyday homes: making beautiful, durable textiles from responsibly sourced materials, paying fair prices along our supply chain, and teaching people the skills to make and repair for themselves. | By 2030, to be London's best-known independent weaving studio: a self-sustaining team of eight makers, a collection stocked by twenty UK independent retailers, a waiting list for our workshops, and a verified low-carbon supply chain from sheep to sofa."
