exports[`Quillfield Automation > Strategy System › 3. Roadmap MM/YY - MM/YY > tile strategy-foundation-0 1`] = `
"Current SituationCurrent SituationiWe sell AI Workflow Audit ($2,500 a project), Automation Build ($7,500 a project) and Automation Care Retainer ($1,200 a month) to NYC Service Firms. The market for NYC Service Firms is growing. We have named 4 competitors for NYC Service Firms; we stand out for making things easy. Customers find and reach us through LinkedIn, Main Website, Booking Page, Newsletter, Direct Email, Referral Partner, Event / Talk, Invoice, Zoom, Slack, Customer Referral, X (Twitter), Agency founder communities, Contact Page and Demo. We start with $10,700 in hand and are seeking $15,000 (SBA Microloan). At the normal level we expect $14,250 a month in revenue, breaking even in Aug 2027. The plan still has a funding gap of $15,218.RefreshiBack‹›Back
[fields] We sell AI Workflow Audit ($2,500 a project), Automation Build ($7,500 a project) and Automation Care Retainer ($1,200 a month) to NYC Service Firms.
The market for NYC Service Firms is growing.
We have named 4 competitors for NYC Service Firms; we stand out for making things easy.
Customers find and reach us through LinkedIn, Main Website, Booking Page, Newsletter, Direct Email, Referral Partner, Event / Talk, Invoice, Zoom, Slack, Customer Referral, X (Twitter), Agency founder communities, Contact Page and Demo.
We start with $10,700 in hand and are seeking $15,000 (SBA Microloan). At the normal level we expect $14,250 a month in revenue, breaking even in Aug 2027. The plan still has a funding gap of $15,218."
`;

